{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/752067-ideas-for-white-howler-game","id":752067,"title":"Ideas for White Howler game?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-03T12:51:06-08:00","id":752067,"title":"Ideas for White Howler game?","content":"unning a game in the days of rome maybe a century before the fall...<br /> <br /> Am looking for ideas...<br /> <br /> one idea I have is a Group of Salubri as enemys for a reason beyond just &quot;Their leeches Kill leeches RAAAH!&quot; <br /> <br /> my working idea, is the PC's wind up working with a shadowlord Sept that faced with destruction because of over expansion of a nearby human community, used disease as a weapon.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T13:08:14-08:00","id":752130,"title":"","content":"Lhiannan could be interesting enemies. After the Roman conquest, perhaps the White Howlers were unable to properly defend one of their southern caerns, and it fell to the Wyrm. Now a nest of the twisted vampire sorcerers infest the caern. Ghouled animals, vegetation bloated on undead blood, banes acting as benefactors to the false druids- perhaps even creating possessed out of some of the most 'holy' vampires.<br /> <br /> Including Fianna and Warders of Men would be good allies/foils for the Shadow Lords and the White Howlers.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T13:10:23-08:00","id":752133,"title":"","content":"ouch these are GOOD ideas...<br /> <br /> Hmmmn is an intelligent skullpig ok as a &quot;Big bad&quot; As their int can go up to 5<br /> <br /> not sure should black spiral dancer gifts even EXIST at this point? but the book says skullpigs gain them<br /> <br /> That could make for a FRIGHTENING archvillain. with the right gifts... <br /> <br /> Oh another idea? <br /> <br /> think Balehound(From Forsaken) Like cults existed prior to the howlers fall?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 11-03-2015, 04:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T13:37:09-08:00","id":752166,"title":"","content":"Glad you like it! A skullpig might be an unusual enemy, but nothing about the filth eating beasts says 'mastermind.' Unless you are wanting to use a skullpig precisely because it is unexpected, some other foe might be a more compelling choice. A Roman General conspiring to invade the north would be a significant problem for the Pictish Garou (the fact that the General is also kinfolk to the Warders of Men could be especially problematic).<br /> <br /> On the other hand, if you want something like a Balehound...<br /> <br /> This idea sort of hinges on which version of the White Howlers' fall you are going with (there are a couple versions knocking around, depending on source book and game version). Black Spiral Dancers as a tribe obviously do not exist, but perhaps you could feature a White Howler falling prey to his base instincts and succumbing to the Wyrm. This could hint at what the White Howlers would become in just a few short generations. Maybe this 'first of the fallen' is the one who discovers the entrance to the Black Spiral in the fist place? Maybe he just barely manages to get inside and the Gaians drag him out to punish him, or perhaps he is a loyal follower of Gaia when he finds the entrance, and only slowly falls into depravity after spending time in its proximity.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3695,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","user":"The Laughing Stranger","date":". 11-03-2015, 04:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T14:13:31-08:00","id":752229,"title":"","content":"Good ideas<br /> <br /> In what ways would a Int 5 Skullpig be a poor Mastermind?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T15:05:11-08:00","id":752271,"title":"","content":"It isn't that the skullpigs are bad as far as enemies go, but for the Big Bad who the heroes can grow to hate and love to hate? Who would the Skullpig inspire, tempt or manipulate? It can deal with other skullpigs and banes, but I feel like something as revolting as a skullpig would have a hard time working with much else, regardless of how intelligent it was. Unless it is an pawn of an Ancient or some other terrifically powerful Wyrm-thing, I think there are other beings that would be more credibly threatening on a wide scale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-03T15:43:05-08:00","id":752292,"title":"","content":"Hmmmn... fair point... It could be the power behind the throne though?<br /> <br /> Hmmmn... Are Baali an overl lame villain choice as their the stereotype for &quot;Big bad&quot; vampires...<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=